    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Onionisin\u201d is a horror adventure game in which you must escape from a village where demons roam by solving various riddles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character wanders into a village while climbing a mountain. However, there is not a soul in the village, but an ogre-like monster with its whole body dyed red is roaming around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the horror performance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scary of the game \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2606\u2606</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains jump scares and other startling effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be careful if you are not good at it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
